Z||000012||sluppy123||02-22-2000||11:56 AM||||Yes, the show did air back in Jan. It was on National syndication Jan. 29&30.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Unfortunately it was only aired in some parts of the country on selected stations. The good news is that it will air on Speedvision Mar. 5&11. (Bad news I don't get Speedvision)So I'll never know if it's on there or not <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by sluppy123 (edited 02-22-2000).]||||reg||1
