Z||000021||Phil||03-14-2000||08:16 AM||||I had my 32 sec. air time on Hot Rod Magazine TV(Speedvision) when they covered the Power Tour East(2nd half). Jeff Koch(one of the 5 editors) picked mine as his Editors Choice. He keeps in touch with me via e-mail telling me that they(Hot Rod) still want to do a photo shoot of it for an article but he keeps moving the date up. Now he says they will try to do it in June when I go on the Power Tour again. Boy do they edit video though, they had the camera running for about 6 min. while we were yaking about the car, wound up with 32 sec. and I was nowhere to be seen.||||reg||1
